{"server":"tw","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_05_end","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_07","title":"龜裂","storyCode":"DM-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"48e9b07353e9bd9dd281ec67d4092cf34c510f755fd64b427cd61589a813b235","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為了將自己的見聞告知W，伊內絲鋌而走險，並遭遇了整合運動的攔截，最後的時刻，她的眼前唯有陰影。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"塔露拉變了。\n第一次見到塔露拉的時候，她給我的感覺，和特蕾西婭殿下很像。\n但殿下一直非常的悲傷，她背負著......也知曉著這片大地的更多秘密。\n塔露拉不同，她很憤怒，足夠冷靜的，卻又充滿熱情的憤怒。\n雖然細小很多，卻同樣強盛。也許他們這樣的人無論力量大小，都擁有著近似的部分。\n這股憤怒催生了整合運動，讓無數追隨者趨之若鶩。\n但很快......就改變了。\n我們每天的工作，變成了煽動、加害和挑撥。\n這不再是一場感染者的革命——\n——而是我們在卡茲戴爾目睹過無數次的，被過度操縱的戰爭陰謀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有追上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我們真的和她正面碰上，事情就麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該對塔露拉使用法術，這也不是第一次了，我們要時常小心自己看見的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉的身上一定發生了什麼，這件事必須告訴W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了W幾次的小動作，我們已經遭到那些暴徒的猜忌了，這還不夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"過去的塔露拉只是個反抗者。她把反抗的機會帶給那些被解放的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"現在呢？他們幾乎毫不收斂自己的欲望，單純的破壞，濫殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"這不足以說明什麼，薩卡茲之外的種族對感染者素來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在說這種行為本身怎麼了，我是在說這樣的行為會招致什麼後果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉她......在葬送整合運動，刻意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得這個情況似曾相識嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她是個優秀的領袖，能將這些普通的感染者捲入戰爭，甚至帶給他們勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但她，也只有她才能用最神不知鬼不覺的方法，一步步毀掉自己一手搭建起來的高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至塔露拉她自己，都只是其中一塊比較精美的磚瓦，隨時可以被粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"和三年前給我的感覺一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但他......他或許素來如此，他可以毫不猶豫地做到這一切......只是藏的很好罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉不同，她的變化太突然了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她的影子......她甚至有兩個影子，不像是法術的痕跡，倒像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"一座廢墟，古老，強盛，滿是那種力量的殘留......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你的法術性質很特殊，儘管如此，你這次的感覺也太模糊了，這還是不構成行動的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但這件事W必須知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"小聲點，我們已經被注意到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"任何動作都會成為別人的把柄，你明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那你覺得我們還能經受住第二次巴別塔那樣的變故嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少W不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找她，既然加爾森已經死了，她就是新的領導人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！如果塔露拉真的已經注意到了，你這樣會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"等不了，別想命令我，現在我們還是平起平坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這麼說，這好像是我第一次抗命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該總是想這麼多的，赫德雷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（W，就在前面，穿過這條巷子就......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（那裡不是營地？她在做什麼？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（總之得快一點——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......？有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的語氣，魔族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"先是有幾支傭兵隊伍叛逃，接著又讓敵人出現在了城內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們犯下的錯誤太多，你該不會以為領袖沒有看在眼裡吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，我沒有義務聽你抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你有這個義務對塔露拉負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——我明白了，等我向W彙報完之後，我會去向塔露拉報到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要的不是這種“負責”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖.....來真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才發生的襲擊波及了這裡，薩卡茲雇傭兵小隊長之一的伊內絲，死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅毅的整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"不去確認她的屍體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才的戰鬥動靜太大，已經有人被吸引過來了，立刻炸毀這條街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅毅的整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動也要有人......和她一併奮戰到了最後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅毅的整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅毅的整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"照顧好我的家人，他們還在城裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我向你許諾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......把他的屍體弄得再像回事一些......好，就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"W很快就會察覺到的......我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒讓赫德雷跟來......果然，是正確的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來，切爾諾伯格街道上的景觀樹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"居然......是樺樹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"差不多的風景，和那裡......都是，交叉的影子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動士兵"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["堅毅的整合運動術師"]}]}
